@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Application Components — Modular Monolith
package "Angular SPA" {
  [Auth & Shell] as authui
  [Customer Transactions] as txui
  [Customer Disputes] as dui
  [Agent Workspace] as aui
}
package "Spring Boot" {
  [Auth / Security] as sec
  [Spring Session JDBC] as sessions
  [Account & Transaction] as trans
  [Dispute API / Application] as app
  [Dispute Domain] as domain
  [Dispute Audit submodule] as audit
  [Idempotency] as idem
  [Technical Infrastructure] as infra
}
database PostgreSQL
authui --> sec
txui --> trans
dui --> app
aui --> app
app --> sec : authenticated principal
app --> trans : owned transaction lookup / lock interface
app --> domain
app --> audit : synchronous append interface

app --> idem
sec --> sessions : server-side sessions
sessions --> PostgreSQL : shared session state
sec --> PostgreSQL : current account state
trans --> PostgreSQL
app --> PostgreSQL
audit --> PostgreSQL
idem --> PostgreSQL
note bottom
One Spring Boot deployment; no cross-module repository access.
Dispute, audit and idempotency writes share one PostgreSQL transaction.
Infrastructure: envelopes, correlation IDs, validation and exception mapping.
No microservices or API Gateway in MVP.
end note
@enduml
